The '''Wand of Mending''' is a {{Rare}} [[Healing Wand]] and [[Support items|Support Item]] unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Zombie Slayer|3}}. It is an upgraded version of the {{Item|Wand of Healing}} and can be upgraded into the {{Item|Wand of Restoration}}. It can only be crafted and used after reaching {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 3}}.

