== Tips ==
* The set bonuses of {{Item|Revenant Armor}} and {{Item|Reaper Armor}} increase healing from [[Healing Wands]] by {{Green|50%}}.
* Each armor piece enchanted with {{Ench|Habanero Tactics 5}} grants {{Green|7.5%}} additional healing from [[Healing Wands]].

== Trivia ==
* Although consecutive casts do not stack, the first healing tick is applied immediately. With enough {{Stat|vitality}}, repeatedly casting the ability can heal {{Stat|hp|160}} per second.

